  "details": "For far too long we have been shown pictures of one world only to go in the world and be disappointed with a world vastly different from their submitted picture/preview. And i mean i get it you have high hopes, but don't post up pictures of something beautiful and make me waste my time discovering you are very far away from that dream.\n\nI also can't imagine this to be good on vrchat's servers. People downloading a world then bailing out to do it again and again and again. Especially with ai making it easy to create these slop worlds.\n\nThis feature involves taking at least two world random pictures taken before you join the world and attaching them to the world preview.\n\nI have included an example.",
